/rssfilter.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://rssfilter.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;🐙&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/loopwerk/django-rss-filter" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://github.com/loopwerk/django-rss-filter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;作者写的介绍日志：&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.loopwerk.io/articles/2025/announcing-rssfilter-com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://www.loopwerk.io/articles/2025/announcing-rssfilter-com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;发现于作者嘟文：&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://hachyderm.io/@kevinrenskers/114308702275578978" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://hachyderm.io/@kevinrenskers/114308702275578978&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;其它类似工具有 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1405" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;RSS-lambda&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1279" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;Feed Filter Maker&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/223" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;siftRSS&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/716" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;Grepfeed&lt;/a&gt; 等&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/FBX1D0K1tdCW4Dy587M0ftX1Xmaj78Nd3p9ZaQgPR53dY9Qv3Afn5CBO833d7BzEyu61qbfVS8RVjeeESrJK4YLiIylu5xRMhRlUTJ-KbmJ6PQksK0iU2nHe1prLBmi-5d3WO0gm06d7z7CDrQksukvlDlGtNcmgRhpRKlzltR80u9_KQoGsgFnTABv-r3ptqak8KIXhPQnPv8oo0sVzN_1HElAjrrqk9MP3_6R5WCDtn3uavFk0s7ZS-NK8FwIfUucbWFmIShPXTIIfD3FZcgt6ugHtQCDcq6M4nvIf15LdrisKbxln3tD1Qbj1pRGsPfkFnIg2y07Vc2GEsjcllg.jpg" width="800" height="252" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1513</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1513</guid><pubDate>Thu, 17 Apr 2025 00:59:04 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 GitHub Repo 「ALL-about-RSS」 五年了</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;GitHub Repo 「ALL-about-RSS」 五年了&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;五年前的今天，我提交了「&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/536" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;ALL-about-RSS&lt;/a&gt;」的第一条 &lt;a href="https://github.com/AboutRSS/ALL-about-RSS/commit/fbb01c3fa2279df9048f23d6cd52e7b04b9daa1c" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;commit&lt;/a&gt;，以彰显 RSS 作为开放规范的多样性和生命力。五年后，该 List 承蒙大家托举，成长为了一个 RSS 玩家的乐土，有开发者来 PR 自己的 RSS 相关作品，有爱好者来纠错补缺，也有&lt;a href="https://rss.tips/#donators" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;捐赠&lt;/a&gt;、加星、关注等各种形式的支持与助力。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://star-history.com/#aboutrss/all-about-rss&amp;amp;Date" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;5K+ &lt;span class="emoji"&gt;⭐️&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/AboutRSS/ALL-about-RSS/forks" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;200+ forks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/aboutrss/all-about-rss/graphs/contributors" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;40+ 位贡献者&lt;/a&gt;，已使 &lt;a href="https://github.com/AboutRSS/ALL-about-RSS/pulls" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;PR 序号来到 #100&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;感谢各位 RSS 玩家，也欢迎继续群策群力。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/J0hVmdG6LRZJfdGeCtdd2V3g6Tg3ynmT3vd5izTxkr5DvdPI8ydl6CiVOHofB7xjT4scc1_P6S2Q7yr6s2L7h-SGRMd4TLNqx5vfmroLh0Q4mBnqJEAOZN7230_hsZ1m_pHOJvDPg6Pd6dH5Iapyh1bt1Px5t-9lBVAQ2RAeM9Zjf4T9LilxmYQQgUCgAXF3sPGmsqawvLDk4_j1jmy30Na-tEmuOBi7h0z0XGwsjNutwjM57VWyEzzrosWgpVxUBB99KiWItA9W8hIUotXFmCt7KCuJRltR6BGFjGLsgTBAShUtYXELQa70PHsWN4CewqoUV6EDtJFv_ulbJ0yb6g.jpg" width="800" height="460" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1512</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1512</guid><pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 01:01:16 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 Fread: 一个支持 RSS 订阅的 Mastodon/Bluesky 客户端</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fread: 一个支持 RSS 订阅的 Mastodon/Bluesky 客户端&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;该 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1511?q=%23Android"&gt;#Android&lt;/a&gt; App 免费，主打长毛象客户端，但也支持订阅 RSS 和 Bluesky，意味着可以构建多渠道的混合 Feed 流。上线于 24 年夏天。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;官网：&lt;a href="https://fread.xyz/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://fread.xyz/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;作者自荐：&lt;a href="https://medium.com/@kezhang404/fread-the-next-generation-mastodon-client-30bc50e279fd" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://medium.com/@kezhang404/fread-the-next-generation-mastodon-client-30bc50e279fd&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;发现于作者推文：&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://x.com/zhangke19/status/1909825627504755112" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://x.com/zhangke19/status/1909825627504755112&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/kXJPROKBwyCRA_FJSkST7pcXfNjduvu3LKkbfKLqiwsCjFUhT0RXZonz5b_HOuyDbsxVXD6muvGcKgXn1y9USO_mEJG9p63kI-6sk1bJ_I_SESNs2JdzEtj3vBZYcvjol5EL8LVBi8skZL7RNz95Y4GFf4ko1MruqYM_m8SxMOJeEr8KN_FqzALWZhyV__eZjyWDnSiLU4Xnq-jHl6HzuVIAd_c81gtvIsGrsHBRaWWTJcUXjYvFu59tS9p6ZlP0rNDmQ6b69emrQWJDn91CbDbb6-WHrvHBGOgeUkT3braz-XMarQFD7R1l5EvPyMJb4OyJyNL0i-_laJ9gPLaAxA.jpg" width="800" height="285" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1511</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1511</guid><pubDate>Wed, 09 Apr 2025 12:02:50 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 MastoLink2RSS : 一个将 #Mastodon 时间线中的 url 抽取出来制成 RSS feed 的 工具</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;MastoLink2RSS : 一个将 &lt;/b&gt;&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1510?q=%23Mastodon"&gt;&lt;b&gt;#Mastodon&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt; 时间线中的 url 抽取出来制成 RSS feed 的 工具&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;频道提及过数个为社交媒体时间线中的链接创建 RSS Feed 的工具（&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/377" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/628" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;2&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1080" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;3&lt;/a&gt;），都没活下来。Twitter/X 的那些可能是因为受限于封闭平台，希望 Fediverse 且 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1510?q=%23%E5%BC%80%E6%BA%90"&gt;#开源&lt;/a&gt; 的这个能长久存活：&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://masto2rss.gedanken.uber.space/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://masto2rss.gedanken.uber.space/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;发现于&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://scholar.social/@gedankenstuecke/113322700501308956" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://scholar.social/@gedankenstuecke/113322700501308956&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/vPP3jEZ6HjOX7lBpes36BWhDenwPQJrDji7dc83Dypt6xxAFN6hkWzQuW7LnKsU8BIFWy2N8yUoBhvS1nl_af66egMbfZdQ0G1uNN0v3ZrIHrEApgarcU2fG9Fu4lr7JrxGqfCry2ZRjIfuTUytHZrtiFQnjfkMlFF3foalMwOjDokvLQ1g223p6BXQdWEK1gFG9ZKdBRksEZV6oSLNDW8QR4kywNgRmTguvzvtCm9sNT0tjwQM_Ll8IiT4tDcQ38JzskJfKk1sHFT0MtT-R1dtW2pK6oF3Y58jejJrth1NWkZuUmDh9wB8PWMEDRL_ehoA8QHQAwQmU4EmlvW686Q.jpg" width="552" height="239" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1510</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1510</guid><pubDate>Mon, 07 Apr 2025 12:02:52 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 与 RSS 有关的 #bookmarking 工具信息四则</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;与 RSS 有关的 &lt;/b&gt;&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1509?q=%23bookmarking"&gt;&lt;b&gt;#bookmarking&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;b&gt; 工具信息四则&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;🔸&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1509?q=%23%E5%BC%80%E6%BA%90"&gt;#开源&lt;/a&gt; 可自架 网摘管理器/稍后读工具 &lt;b&gt;Linkwarden&lt;/b&gt; v2.9 支持 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1509?q=%23RSS2bookmark"&gt;#RSS2bookmark&lt;/a&gt; 以及为公开收录输出 RSS Feed&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.linkwarden.app/releases/2.9" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://blog.linkwarden.app/releases/2.9&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;🔸&lt;/span&gt; 开源 可自架 网摘管理器/稍后读工具 &lt;b&gt;Hoarder&lt;/b&gt; v0.19 支持 RSS2bookmark&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/hoarder-app/hoarder/discussions/632" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://github.com/hoarder-app/hoarder/discussions/632&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;🔸&lt;/span&gt;Pocket RSS: 一个因为 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1509?q=%23Pocket"&gt;#Pocket&lt;/a&gt; 停止为公开收录生成 RSS 而诞生的服务&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://pocket-rss.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://pocket-rss.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;🔸&lt;/span&gt;Linkboard: 免费版支持订阅 5 个 RSS 以供 RSS2bookmark&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://linkboard.leonifrancesco.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://linkboard.leonifrancesco.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;同类可与 RSS 互动的 收藏夹 工具还有 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1509?q=%23Wallabag"&gt;#Wallabag&lt;/a&gt; 、 &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1509?q=%23Pinboard"&gt;#Pinboard&lt;/a&gt;、 Raindrop 等。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/E5iPBismAbroneQYvln2buaAFqRTUywWug2Erj4fOWtUUTxOnfaps_wb-4AXt67I2DY_0dUsp2cJ5Oh83Yg-JVaVxsotn2GlMgSQUHRQX0d_9gCzvmJNn5Hnx8O5eJwzN1RNJI9Jvz_9WwrZJN2HdEN2aqVpQ_AWwvb9zxcWV8kWZUyUUV3TxT6RAHeBcTu0K3Sn6oFitzGOREb9Yq5wxDvge5_8gvAydp8DRC7vJO8SFxoc5gRg-6CSFN2hejxSRnxvNGYDPKCZ_TZK4dSuE48EEIPbezIFMqLCxf4lEFDt3J5j730Q_Oa1NU66-R0grKgIe8vFoCI7r9r8X39oGQ.jpg" width="800" height="444" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1509</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1509</guid><pubDate>Sat, 05 Apr 2025 09:34:46 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>